---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | VibePrompt"
  description="Privacy policy for VibePrompt: what we collect (almost nothing), analytics we use, and how advertising cookies may apply."
>
  <nav class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4"><a href="/" class="hover:text-foreground">Home</a> / Privacy</nav>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-5">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-sm">
    <p><em>Last updated: September 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      VibePrompt ("we", "this site") is a static content website. We do not require accounts, we do not ask for personal information, and we do not sell data.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground pt-2">Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use privacy-friendly, aggregate analytics to understand which pages are useful. This data is not used to identify individual visitors.</p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground pt-2">Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display advertising served by third parties (such as Google AdSense). Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on
      prior visits to this and other websites. You may opt out of personalized advertising via
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="text-primary hover:underline" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground pt-2">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? See the <a href="/contact/" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
